And I just remembered his name is Rolph.

337
00:16:06,996 --> 00:16:08,200
你居然忘记欧图这名字
You forgot the name Rolph

338
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,100
我们不是才看见一个妞手里捧着"呕吐"物吗
after we just saw a girl do that in her Hands?

339
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:13,159
这里很好吧
Isn't it lovely here?

340
00:16:13,159 --> 00:16:15,780
少一分嘈杂 多一分高贵
Less Blarney's, more Barney's.

341
00:16:15,780 --> 00:16:17,920
相信我 这里的鸡尾酒很出名
And trust me, these bellinis are famous.

342
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:19,320
为什么 它们有拍性爱影片吗
Why? Did they make a sex tape?

343
00:16:21,220 --> 00:16:23,220
味道有点像那次我把
Ooh, kind of tastes like the time

344
00:16:23,220 --> 00:16:25,100
罐头黄桃放进我的盒装葡萄酒
I put canned peaches in my boxed wine.

345
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:30,040
麦克斯 这两者有云泥之别好吗
Max, a Plaza bellini is a far cry from boxed wine.

346
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:33,580
我的原则是一旦冷藏过 就是高档货
Well, my rule is, if I have to refrigerate it, it's fancy.

347
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:36,860
说你呢 电池
I'm talkin' to you, batteries.

348
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:41,720
今晚真是让我
You know, tonight is really bringing up

349
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:42,980
无比怀念过去的我
how much I miss the old me.

350
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:45,420
是啊 今晚真是让我
Yeah, tonight is really bringing up

351
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:46,660
无比怀念我的朋友阿齐
How much I miss my friend Archie.

352
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:48,240
谁
Who?

353
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:50,580
被你用香槟气球砸过的那个人
The guy you hit with the champagne balloons.

354
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:52,260
在罗得岛卖汽车座套
Sells car seat covers in Rhode Island.

355
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:54,640
你还记得我说他过得很好吗
You know how I said he was doing really well?

356
00:16:55,340 --> 00:16:56,700
其实我有一年没跟他说话了
Truth is I haven't talked to him in a year.

357
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,220
我真是犯了个大错
Really dropped the ball.

358
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:02,900
这地方最让人兴奋的一点是
And the most exciting thing about this place--

359
00:17:03,280 --> 00:17:05,080
那些电梯门随时会打开
those elevator doors can open,

360
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,600
你永远也不知道会是谁走出来
and you never know who's gonna step off.

361
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,520
麦克斯 感觉真好
Max, this is nice.

362
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,760
麦克斯 好无聊啊 怎么搞的
Max, this is boring. What happened?

363
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:23,580
没得搞 啥搞头都没有
Nothing. Absolutely nothing.

364
00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:25,500
现在我开始怀疑或许
Now I'm thinking maybe this wasn't

365
00:17:25,500 --> 00:17:27,060
这里没我想得那么好玩
as much fun as I thought it was.

366
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:29,380
现在我开始怀疑阿齐死了
Now I'm thinking Archie's dead.

367
00:17:32,340 --> 00:17:34,740
因为我好像收到过通知短信 但被我无视了
'cause I feel like I got a text about it and ignored it.

368
00:17:36,840 --> 00:17:38,940
就连这鸡尾酒都没以前好喝了
Even this bellini doesn't taste as good.

369
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:41,640
我就知道 我的味蕾早在我吃了第一块
I knew it, my taste buds must have committed suicide

370
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,300
廉价寿司后就自杀了
after my first 7-11 sushi.

371
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:47,640
一切都不一样了
I mean, nothing is the same.

372
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,360
我以前怎么会觉得这里好玩呢
Why did I think this was fun?

373
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:52,600
因为在你遇见我之前 你根本不知道什么叫好玩
Because before you met me, you didn't know what fun was.

374
00:17:53,820 --> 00:17:55,180
我懂你的意思 麦克斯
I get your point, Max,

375
00:17:55,180 --> 00:17:57,700
但我以前拥有一座加勒比海小岛 和六辆水上摩托车
But I did own a Caribbean Island with six jet skis.

376
00:17:58,220 --> 00:17:59,940
拜托 忘掉过去吧
Oh, come on, get over it.

377
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:01,340
干杯 现在也没那么惨
Drink up. It's not that bad.

378
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:03,080
你就不能让我自怨自艾一下吗
Can you just let me feel sad?

379
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:03,940
不行
No!

380
00:18:04,420 --> 00:18:06,240
至少在圣帕特里克节不行
Not on St. Patrick's Day.

381
00:18:06,940 --> 00:18:08,220
你要好好享乐
You have a good time,

382
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,880
不要再想不开心的事情
and you don't think about your problems.

383
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,260
那个吐在手里的女孩
That girl who threw up in her hands,

384
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:14,400
她也没有坐在那里抱怨 "我的人生糟透了"
she didn't sit around saying, "eh, meh, my life sucks."

385
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:16,520
她举起双手 用力一甩
No, she threw her hands in the air,

386
00:18:16,740 --> 00:18:17,980
把呕吐物砸向大家
hit a lot of people with the vomit,

387
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:20,580
然后继续派对
and kept the party going.

388
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:24,860
是啊 她的"派对"都沾在大家的鞋上了
Yeah, the party was all over everybody's shoes.

389
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:28,280
听着 虽然这地方是我这辈子
Look, it doesn't matter that this is literally

390
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:30,780
去过最傻逼最做作的地方
the stupidest place I've ever been in my whole frickin' life.

391
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,860
但我们再点一杯40块的名导鸡尾酒
Let's get another $40 Roberto Benigni

392
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,240
继续我们的派对吧
and keep our party going.

393
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:39,060
算了 走吧 这里没有派对
Come on, let's go. There's no party here.

394
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:41,480
或许楼上花费三百万的犹太成人礼有派对
There may be a $3 million bat mitzvah happening upstairs,

395
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:42,860
但咱们这里绝对没有
but there's no party here.

396
00:18:42,940 --> 00:18:44,060
但我知道哪里会有
But I do know where there is one.

397
00:18:44,060 --> 00:18:45,720
麻烦结账 欧图
We'll just take the check, Rolph.

398
00:18:46,800 --> 00:18:48,600
我突然又想起来他应该叫丹尼斯
And I just remembered his name is Dennis.

399
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:55,340
麦克斯 抱歉在你过节的时候倒苦水
Max, I'm sorry if I rained on your parade today.

400
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:56,780
好吧 是尿
Well, peed on it.

401
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:58,680
别担心
Don't worry about it.

402
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,720
一切对我来说有意义的东西 都会被尿
Everything that means something to me gets peed on.

403
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:03,879
姑娘们 听说你们走了
Hey, girls! I heard you left!

404
00:19:03,879 --> 00:19:07,888
你们错过我赢得呼啦圈大赛那一刻
You missed me winning the hula-hooping contest.

405
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,980
你什么时候学会扭呼啦圈了
When did you learn how to hula-hoop?

406
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:12,760
再说一遍 我不知道
Once again, I do not know.

407
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:16,880
你这身风笛手服还是很好看啊
You're still rocking the bagpipe ensemble.

408
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:17,740
你不是说你穿裙子的事
I thought you wanted to keep

409
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:19,320
想要保持低调 "深锁柜中"吗
your skirt wearing on the low-low.

410
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:22,160
在我感受到我裙底的风"笛"与风"囊"
That was before I discovered the sensation

411
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:26,160
被凉风吹过的爽快感后 我就无所谓了
of a cool breeze circling my bag and my pipe.

412
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:31,520
麦克斯 卡洛琳
Hey! Max, Caroline!

413
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:34,320
不好意思 借过 借过
Excuse me, move it. Move it. Move it.

414
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:36,520
让开 想弄坏老娘超大的三叶草吗
Hey, move it. Wanna break my big-ass clover?

415
00:19:38,900 --> 00:19:40,700
姑娘们 你们去哪里了
Girls, where did you go?

416
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:43,420
我们去了广场酒店 然后我发现
We went to The Plaza, and I realized my life

417
00:19:43,420 --> 00:19:45,940
心灵的富有比金钱更让我感到富有
may actually be richer now than when I was rich.

418
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:49,400
不是吧 已经来不及抽身了吗
Oh, no. Is it too late to walk away?

419
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:54,420
你们俩能借我点现金吗
Can you girls loan me some cash?

420
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:56,700
我泡到了一个女孩 我从她姐姐在
I met a girl, and I need money for the bus

421
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:59,100
新泽西的公寓回来时 需要一点公车费
back from her sister's condo in Jersey city.

422
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:02,880
她说不能太大声 我说这我可不能保证
She said we've got to be quiet, but I make no promises.

423
00:20:04,220 --> 00:20:06,500
我支持你 阿憨 你需要多少 20块吗
Sure. I gotcha, Han. What do you need, a 20?

424
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:09,440
管它的 拿50块去吧 钱还可以再赚
Oh, what the hell? Take 50. We can always make more.

425
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:10,320
或赚不到了
Or not.

426
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:12,720
瞧你撒钱的样子
Look at you throwing the cash around.

427
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,540
美女 人生路上说不定还有希望呢
You know, girl, there might be hope for you yet.

428
00:20:15,700 --> 00:20:16,860
珍宁 我准备好啦
Jeanine, I'm good to go.

429
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:25,880
我就跟你们说了 百分之百
Told you, girls. 100%.

430
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:29,320
看来今晚他们俩都要"不爽"一发了
Looks like they're both gonna get unlucky tonight.

431
00:20:31,740 --> 00:20:33,720
麦克斯 卡洛琳 这边
Hey, Max, Caroline, over here!

432
00:20:34,293 --> 00:20:35,940
我帮你们留了位置
I save ya a couple of seats.

433
00:20:35,940 --> 00:20:37,820
还留了几个消防员
And a couple of firemen.

434
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:41,640
没有位置坐啊
Uh, there's no place to sit.

435
00:20:42,060 --> 00:20:42,965
你真是太嫩了
Oh, you are so green.

436
00:20:42,965 --> 00:20:45,860
你好
'Sup?

437
00:20:45,860 --> 00:20:50,226
圣帕特里克节快乐 我的亲亲在哪里
Happy st. Paddy's day! Where's me kiss?

438
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:02,080
威士忌与鱼啊
Scotch and fish!
